List, show, select, and fork model profiles.

Usage:
  strap model list
  strap model show current
  strap model current
  strap model use gpt-5.5-chatgpt
  strap model fork gpt-5.4-chatgpt gpt-5.5-chatgpt --set-model-id gpt-5.5
  strap model roots

Model profiles are layered JSON artifacts discovered from `.strap-user/models`, `.strap/models`, config models, and root models. Runtime commands default to `--model current`.
